Subject: [PATCH 02/10] cal: fix signed integer overflow [AddressSanitizer]
Date: Sun, 30 Nov 2014 13:57:34 +0000
Message-Id: <1417355862-16935-3-git-send-email-kerolasa@iki.fi>
In-Reply-To: <1417355862-16935-1-git-send-email-kerolasa@iki.fi>
